MID_MV12_09: <SH>
MID_MV12_09_m001: (react, vomiting blood)
MID_MV12_09_m002: (walla: audience in shock/awe)
MID_MV12_09_m002_2: *gasp and then gleeful laugh*
MID_MV12_09_m003: And still you fight?
MID_MV12_09_m004: *ragged breath*
MID_MV12_09_m005: *gasp*
MID_MV12_09_m006: Though the act itself may consume me...
MID_MV12_09_m007: the pleasure I will feel in defeating one such as you...
MID_MV12_09_m008: it moves me!
MID_MV12_09_m009: *short breath then knowing gasp*
MID_MV12_09_m010: Dietrich, anything but this...
MID_MV12_09_m011: Fabio! Is this what happened to Cetus?
MID_MV12_09_m011_2: *6-7 beat glee chuckles*
MID_MV12_09_m012: Oh...you would truly give in.\nIs your lust for battle so fierce?
MID_MV12_09_m013: Stop now!
MID_MV12_09_m014: Don't do this, Dietrich! There's\nno coming back if you do!
MID_MV12_09_m015: Sweetie, stop it! Please stop it!
MID_MV12_09_m016: *determined grunt*
MID_MV12_09_m017: Dietrich! Dietrich, you are no beast!
MID_MV12_09_m018: (gasp, looking up at Fabio, amazed that\nhe has changed his opinion of humans)
MID_MV12_09_m019: *growl of understanding*
MID_MV12_09_m020: *grunt of recognition*